{"body":[{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45970_1720.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"p","x":"QINGDAO, China (AVING) -- <Visual News> Lenovo presented its red color notebook pc with design motif of sacred-fire in China market during SINOCES 2007, which commemorates 2008 Beijing Olympic Game. It contains 12.1-inch LCD display supporting 1,280x800 resolution."},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45971_1721.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45972_1721.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45973_1721.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45974_1721.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45975_1721.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9623_45976_1721.jpg","cap":""}]}